WEBVTT

00:01:58.929 --> 00:02:03.116
That may sound like
an exaggeration, but it's not.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.369
If we continue on the current path,

00:02:05.393 --> 00:02:09.394
we condemn our children
and their descendants

00:02:09.418 --> 00:02:14.173
to a world that is
increasingly uninhabitable,

00:02:14.197 --> 00:02:17.417
with exponentially
growing levels of disease,

00:02:17.441 --> 00:02:19.074
famine, and conflict,

00:02:19.098 --> 00:02:23.201
and irreversible ecosystem failures.

00:02:23.225 --> 00:02:28.444
Conversely, if we cut our current
greenhouse gas emissions in half

00:02:28.468 --> 00:02:30.159
over the next 10 years,